{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことあったー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華から本借りた！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ASIAN KUNG-FU GENERATIONさんの\nゴッチさんの本！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うひゃーー大好き。大切に読もーっと(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.L.T.さん、発売中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全メンバーが登場してるので、\nぜひ見てみてね(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣着たよ♩♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏だねぇ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、風鈴の音が聞きたくてね、\n買って窓に吊るしてみたんだけど、、、\n風がなくて全然音がならない（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わりに、窓開けてると\n蝉の声が聴こえる。\nそれもまた良きかな(* ´ω ｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり夏が一番すき！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わちゃわちゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特になんの意味もありません（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FNS うたの夏祭り\n出演させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー  in  大阪\n無事終了致しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日間、3公演 有難うございました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年は、大阪城ホールを埋めることができず、\n空席を見ながら切ないというか、\nちょっぴり悔しさの残るライブでしたが、\n今年はなんと満席で、同じ会場でも見える景色が\n胸がいっぱいになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お一人お一人にお礼を言いたいくらいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、もっともっと大きくなって\n戻ってこれるように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあとのツアーも沢山\n頑張ります！(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nこのリハ期間中・本番に\nお誕生日を迎えた、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったん、きいちゃん、ろってぃー\n改めてお誕生日おめでとう！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年になりますように(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでもって、\nれいかー早く戻ってきてー！（笑）\nやっぱりキャプテンがいないと、寂しいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言いつつ、良くなるように祈ってるから、\n今は安心してちゃんと休むんだぞ！\nのんびり待ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は東京に帰って時間があったので、\n舞台観てきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またひとつ勉強になった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージ立つのも見るのも好きだなあって\n改めて思った今日この頃でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今ステージって打ったらステーキ食べたくなってきた！（笑）\nうーお腹すいたー！\nあ、アイスキャンディ美味しかったなあ(((o( ˆoˆ )o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/07/25/7280251/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}